  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:400px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-black pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Death-Force Absorption</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/c/ca/Nekron.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20200613064240\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Nekron\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/c/ca/Nekron.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20200613064240\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/c/ca/Nekron.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20200613064240 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/c/ca/Nekron.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1032?cb=20200613064240 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Nekron\" width=\"270\" height=\"352\" data-image-key=\"Nekron.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Nekron.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Nekron (DC Comics) can absorb death-force to enhance his already formidable abilities.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb death-force.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The ability to <b>absorb death-force and utilize it in some way</b>. Combination of <a href=\"/wiki/Power_Absorption\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Absorption\">Power Absorption</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Death-Force_Manipulation\" title=\"Death-Force Manipulation\">Death-Force Manipulation</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a>. Opposite to <a href=\"/wiki/Life-Force_Absorption\" title=\"Life-Force Absorption\">Life-Force Absorption</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Variations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Variations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDeath-Force_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Death-Force Assimilation/Draining/Siphoning</li>\n<li>Death Energy Absorption/Assimilation/Draining/Siphoning</li>\n<li>Killing Energy Absorption/Assimilation/Draining/Siphoning</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDeath-Force_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can absorb death-force, while removing it from the source, into their body and use it in various ways, gaining some form of advantage, either by <a href=\"/wiki/Enhanced_Condition\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Enhanced Condition\">enhancing</a> themselves, <a href=\"/wiki/Power_Absorption\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Absorption\">gaining</a> the drained power, using it as <a href=\"/wiki/Power_Source\" title=\"Power Source\">power source</a>, etc., either temporarily or permanently.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDeath-Force_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Assimilation_Shield\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Assimilation Shield\">Assimilation Shield</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Conversion_Resurrection\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Conversion Resurrection\">Conversion Resurrection</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Death-Force_Blast\" title=\"Death-Force Blast\">Death-Force Blast</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Death-Force_Empowerment\" title=\"Death-Force Empowerment\">Death-Force Empowerment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Necroplasmic_Conversion\" title=\"Necroplasmic Conversion\">Necroplasmic Conversion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Physical_Augmentation\" title=\"Physical Augmentation\">Physical Augmentation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Post-Mortem_Power_Absorption\" title=\"Post-Mortem Power Absorption\">Post-Mortem Power Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Regenerative_Healing_Factor\" title=\"Regenerative Healing Factor\">Regenerative Healing Factor</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Variations\">Variations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDeath-Force_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><b><a href=\"/wiki/Soul_Absorption\" title=\"Soul Absorption\">Soul Absorption</a></b>: absorb deathly force from dead souls.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDeath-Force_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Death_Absorption\" title=\"Death Absorption\">Death Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Death-Force_Manipulation\" title=\"Death-Force Manipulation\">Death-Force Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Death_Manipulation\" title=\"Death Manipulation\">Death Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Post-Mortem_Shapeshifting\" title=\"Post-Mortem Shapeshifting\">Post-Mortem Shapeshifting</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Absorption\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Absorption\">Power Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Soul_Manipulation\" title=\"Soul Manipulation\">Soul Manipulation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDeath-Force_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Death_Recreation\" title=\"Death Recreation\">Death Recreation</a></li>\n<li>May be limit as to how much death-force can be absorbed.</li>\n<li>May damage user’s body without proper management.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Immunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Absorption Immunity\">Absorption Immunity</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Negation\" title=\"Absorption Negation\">Absorption Negation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDeath-Force_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://dynamiteentertainment.fandom.com/wiki/Ernest_Fairchild_(Chaos!_Universe)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:dynamiteentertainment:Ernest Fairchild (Chaos! Universe)\">Ernest Fairchild/Evil Ernie</a> (<i>Chaos! Comics</i>/<i>Dynamite Entertainment</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://dynamiteentertainment.fandom.com/wiki/Sakkara_(Chaos!_Universe)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:dynamiteentertainment:Sakkara (Chaos! Universe)\">Sakkara/Purgatori</a> (<i>Chaos! Comics</i>/<i>Dynamite Entertainment</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://dc.fandom.com/wiki/Nekron_(New_Earth)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:dc:Nekron (New Earth)\">Nekron</a> (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://fairytail.fandom.com/wiki/Zeref_Dragneel\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:fairytail:Zeref Dragneel\">Zeref Dragneel</a> (<i>Fairy Tail</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://godofwar.fandom.com/wiki/Hades\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:godofwar:Hades\">Hades</a> (<i>God of War series</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://marvel.fandom.com/wiki/Melody_Jacobs_(Earth-616)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:marvel:Melody Jacobs (Earth-616)\">Melody Jacobs/Threnody</a> (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://prototype.fandom.com/wiki/Evolved\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:prototype:Evolved\">Evolved</a> (<i>Prototype Series</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://smite.fandom.com/wiki/Hades\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:smite:Hades\">Hades</a> (<i>SMITE</i>)</li>\n<li>Death (<i>Netflix's Castlevania</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://nano-mashine.fandom.com/wiki/Cheon_Ma\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:nano-mashine:Cheon Ma\">Cheon Ma</a> (<i>Wolyaverse/Myst, Might, and Mayhem</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-edi